      "label": "school_main_chara_mathteacher_01",
      "hash64": "1F03A89EE640703E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好。\\n有問題的話，歡迎隨時發問喔。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
