      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_01",
      "hash64": "1E92750EDE0E0DFB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不用在意我，\\n好好休息吧。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
