      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_02",
      "hash64": "1E92760EDE0E0FAE",
      "text": "如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有推薦的甜點店，\\n請務必和我分享情報。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
