      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_01",
      "hash64": "0608EFBD7D0DCC30",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好啊～[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳有去收集寶可夢嗎？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
